{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The derivation that 792 digits yield 300 pages is compatible with the interpretation that 'pages' means numbered sides rather than physical leaves, sharing the mechanism of single-number-per-side allocation; it is refuted if 'pages' means physical leaves (sheets), since each leaf has two numbered sides and the page count would be halved to 150.","id":"272f8a2e77f52fe87d078399ed03b6d9037888fa879463019154299a1208eacf","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@b0157265583d","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"07e5ec5353964f69789981fb5d84609a7f1c4f928ead586bb49150031f658689"},{"role":"dependence","target":"2124bad500e0ca347575614b11daf7d929a0c93301a89b2748d1bd42ca72a85e"},{"role":"dependence","target":"29f23853392ebe0ff9b3628d284cfb3af6b3651bae13921131a56f9c6fcba26e"},{"role":"dependence","target":"89bbc3366a7e134c51e53a689b437d336c069a2e589186ef0363d67409817a54"},{"role":"dependence","target":"f4452fb480dcb444bafad5dcfc3920f414451ac8dca510c6857a9aab08fcd030"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":800,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-3"},"warrants":[]},"id":"272f8a2e77f52fe87d078399ed03b6d9037888fa879463019154299a1208eacf","schema":"artifact"}